        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e19adc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-26T17:09:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah I've seen it… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span>I imagine there's not a lot one can do to flag something with Kickstarter?&nbsp;</span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_frowning_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>It's disappointing, too, because I've liked what I've seen of their artists' (\"Tentacles and Teeth\") work in other places, kind of hoping he didn't realize that his work was going on someone's copycat product. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
